# Lumenhold Academy — 简体中文 (zh-CN) translation of content/world/places.grim
# Maintained by `node tools/grim.js i18n zh-CN`. Translate the text after "="; keep {tokens}.
# "# en:" shows the English source. [hash] marks the English version a line was translated from;
# lines marked STALE need updating — after fixing the text, delete the [hash] and re-run the tool.


@place courtyard
# en: The Courtyard
name [1b8037] = 庭院
# en: Flagstones worn smooth by three centuries of students, a fountain that freezes when it shouldn't, and the best gossip in the castle.
desc [d60535] = 被三百年学生踩得光滑的石板，一座总在不该结冰时结冰的喷泉，以及全城堡最好的八卦。

@place library
# en: The Library
name [64e91f] = 图书馆
# en: Seven floors of shelves that rearrange themselves when nobody is looking. Footnote the cat keeps order.
desc [9e9a17] = 七层书架，趁没人注意时自己重新排列。图书馆猫“脚注”负责维持秩序。

@place refectory
# en: The Refectory
name [0b96c1] = 膳堂
# en: Long tables, longer benches, and soup that tastes faintly of whatever you're homesick for.
desc [289d61] = 长桌，更长的长凳，还有一种汤——它尝起来隐约像你正在想念的那个地方。

@place lakeshore
# en: The Lakeshore
name [6c0614] = 湖岸
# en: The Mirror Lake lies so still it shows the towers upside down. On some nights it shows other things.
desc [733f61] = 镜湖静得能倒映出倒立的塔楼。有些夜晚，它倒映出的是别的东西。

@place village
# en: The Village Square
name [a1e00b] = 村庄广场
# en: A barge ride across the lake: crooked roofs, a market square, a bakery that has fed students for two hundred years and shopkeepers who have seen every kind of student.
desc [88b626] = 乘驳船渡过湖面就到：歪歪扭扭的屋顶、一个集市广场、一家给学生们供应了两百年面包的烘焙坊，还有见识过各种学生的店主们。

@place lecture_tower
# en: The Lecture Tower
name [d37b7f] = 讲堂塔
# en: Spiral lecture halls stacked one above another. Evocation on the lower floors, where scorch marks are expected; Umbral Theory at the top, where the lamps burn dim.
desc [3bff12] = 一层叠一层的螺旋讲堂。塑能术在底层——那里的焦痕是意料之中的事；暗影理论在顶层，灯光昏暗。

@place observatory
# en: The Observatory
name [202edc] = 观星台
# en: A brass dome at the top of the east tower. The great telescope points wherever it likes; usually that is the right place.
desc [4813c0] = 东塔顶上的黄铜穹顶。大望远镜想指向哪儿就指向哪儿——通常，那正是该看的地方。

@place great_hall
# en: The Great Hall
name [e97d10] = 大礼堂
# en: Floating candles, a vaulted ceiling that shows tomorrow's weather, and the stage where the choir rehearses and the Midwinter Ball is held.
desc [eb7d92] = 漂浮的蜡烛，能显示明天天气的拱顶，还有合唱团排练、仲冬舞会举办的舞台。

@place infirmary
# en: The Infirmary
name [b3b383] = 医务室
# en: Clean white beds, a cupboard of tonics and Sister Amaranth, who has seen every kind of injury and believes none of the excuses.
desc [80a36a] = 洁白的床铺，一柜子补药，还有阿玛兰斯修女——她见过各种伤，却一个借口都不信。

@place alchemy_lab
# en: The Alchemy Laboratory
name [333e04] = 炼金实验室
# en: Long benches, cauldrons in every size, and a ventilation charm that has given up on the third floor.
desc [9767f5] = 长长的工作台，大大小小的坩埚，还有一道早就放弃了三楼的通风咒。

@place workshop
# en: Mir's Workshop
name [4b161e] = 米尔的工坊
# en: A former classroom full of springs, gears, half-finished machines and the smell of solder. Fire buckets by the door, on the faculty's orders.
desc [fed5e7] = 一间旧教室，堆满弹簧、齿轮、半成品机器和焊锡味。门边按教职员的要求摆着几只灭火桶。
# en: Something clanks and hums behind the west-wing tapestry.
hint [507a91] = 西翼挂毯后面，有什么东西在叮当作响、嗡嗡低鸣。

@place job_board
# en: The Job Board
name [377c1b] = 招工告示板
# en: A cork board in the entrance hall layered with notices: jobs, lost familiars, club recruitment and the occasional ransom note for a sock.
desc [4e9473] = 门厅里的一块软木板，层层叠叠贴满告示：招工、走失的使魔、社团招新，偶尔还有一封某只袜子的赎金信。

@place ledger_office
# en: The Lumen Ledger Office
name [fdd2aa] = 《流明纪事报》编辑部
# en: A cramped room under the library stairs, walls papered with old front pages. The printing press groans like a dragon on deadline night.
desc [40d726] = 图书馆楼梯下一间逼仄的小屋，墙上贴满旧头版。截稿之夜，印刷机呻吟得像一条赶工的龙。

@place headmistress_tower
# en: The Headmistress's Tower
name [735fdf] = 院长塔
# en: Books, tea and a board of crystal towers by the window. You are only here because she wants you here.
desc [a5fc77] = 书、茶，还有窗边一盘水晶塔棋。你会在这里，只因为她想让你在这里。
# en: A spiral stair guarded by a stone owl that only opens its eyes for some students.
hint [49a3ae] = 一道由石头猫头鹰把守的螺旋楼梯——它只为某些学生睁开眼睛。

@place restricted_section
# en: The Restricted Section
name [b1cf8a] = 禁书区
# en: Black-bound books that breathe in the dark. Some of them read you back.
desc [9d32a6] = 在黑暗中呼吸的黑皮书。有些书会反过来读你。
# en: A door at the back of the library that is always locked, and always slightly warm.
hint [16cc43] = 图书馆最里面有一扇门，总是锁着，而且总是微微发烫。

@place gargoyle_passage
# en: The Third Gargoyle
name [e05e0b] = 第三座石像鬼
# en: Behind the third gargoyle on the north parapet, a passage that isn't on any map. Except theirs.
desc [e1c46f] = 北侧护墙上第三座石像鬼背后，有一条任何地图上都没有的通道。除了他们的地图。
# en: Corvin keeps glancing at a particular gargoyle.
hint [b7dd0a] = 科尔文总忍不住瞟向某一座石像鬼。

@place night_market
# en: The Night Market
name [8fbd8e] = 夜市
# en: A field past the last stile, full of hooded stalls and coloured flames on the moonless night of every term month, and empty grass by dawn.
desc [b2c8bb] = 最后一道篱阶外的一片田野：每个学期月里没有月亮的那一夜，满是戴兜帽的摊位和彩色火焰，天亮时只剩一片草地。
# en: The village says there's something in the far field after midnight, when there's no moon.
hint [f99e39] = 村里人说，没有月亮的夜里过了午夜，远田里会有些东西。

@place seventh_tower
# en: The Seventh Tower
name [44b8dc] = 第七塔
# en: Locked for a century. At the very top, one room of dust and moonlight, and a star-shaped hollow in the wall.
desc [f3b2a5] = 已经锁了一个世纪。塔顶只有一间屋子：灰尘、月光，以及墙上一个星形的凹槽。
# en: A locked stair that leads up into a tower nobody admits is there.
hint [5d54eb] = 一道上锁的楼梯，通往一座没人承认存在的塔。

@place thesis_lab
# en: The Thesis Laboratory
name [92f1a5] = 论文实验室
# en: Rows of carrels where final-year students and their advisors argue about footnotes until the candles give out.
desc [136592] = 一排排研读隔间，毕业年级的学生和导师在这里为脚注争论，直到蜡烛燃尽。

@place duel_hall
# en: The Duelling Hall
name [481ae1] = 决斗厅
# en: Scorched floorboards and a ceiling that has seen things. The practice dummies have names, and grudges.
desc [5bea7b] = 烧焦的地板，和一块见过太多场面的天花板。练习用的假人都有名字，也都记仇。
# en: Steel rings somewhere above the east stair.
hint [96a1b0] = 东侧楼梯上方，某处传来金铁交鸣。

@place greenhouses
# en: The Greenhouses
name [27cc8e] = 温室
# en: Glass houses that steam even in winter. The moonflowers bloom once every eleven years; the mandrakes have opinions every day.
desc [b1e233] = 冬天也冒着热气的玻璃房。月光花每十一年才开一次；曼德拉草每天都有意见。

@place flight_field
# en: The Flight Field
name [ee78ba] = 飞行场
# en: A long green field with hoops at either end and a wind that cheats. Broom lessons, races and spectacular landings.
desc [1c581a] = 一片狭长的草场，两端各立着圆环，风总爱作弊。飞帚课、竞速，以及各种壮观的着陆。

@place stables
# en: The Familiar Stables
name [151887] = 魔宠马厩
# en: Hippogriffs, a sulky griffon chick, owls in the rafters and Professor Brask, who talks to all of them more kindly than to students.
desc [b3d42f] = 鹰头马身有翼兽、一只闹脾气的狮鹫幼崽、椽子上的猫头鹰，还有布拉斯克教授——她对它们说话比对学生温柔得多。

@place boathouse
# en: The Boathouse
name [ba1cb2] = 船屋
# en: An old wooden boathouse and a jetty out over the water. People come here to say the things they can't say indoors.
desc [cf59e4] = 一座旧木船屋，一道伸向水面的栈桥。人们来这里说那些在室内说不出口的话。

@place orchard
# en: The Orchard
name [f7870f] = 果园
# en: Apple and pear trees older than the towers. In spring the blossom falls like snow; once, it was snow.
desc [73fd80] = 比塔楼还老的苹果树和梨树。春天花落如雪；有一次，落下的真是雪。

@place maud_cottage
# en: Old Maud's Cottage
name [37a3a6] = 老莫德的小屋
# en: A thatched cottage with chickens on the doorstep, bees in the eaves, a goat called Bartholomew and a kettle that is always nearly boiling. Behind it, apple and pear trees older than the towers.
desc [fe0949] = 茅草屋顶的小屋，门阶上有鸡，屋檐下有蜂，一只叫巴塞洛缪的山羊，还有一壶永远快要烧开的水。屋后是比七塔还古老的苹果树和梨树。

@place secret_garden
# en: The Secret Garden
name [2193f1] = 秘密花园
# en: Glowing ferns, silver bees and a pear tree that hums. It only exists for people Maud has shown it to.
desc [7a21e5] = 发光的蕨类、银色的蜜蜂，还有一棵会哼歌的梨树。它只为莫德带进来过的人存在。
# en: A door in the wall behind the potting shed that you keep walking past.
hint [17ccd0] = 盆栽棚后面的墙上有一扇门，你总是从它旁边走过去。

@place courier_loft
# en: The Courier Loft
name [ef540e] = 信使阁楼
# en: A draughty loft full of parcels, pigeonholes and brooms in various states of repair. The dispatch bell rings at all hours.
desc [6cb721] = 一间漏风的阁楼，堆满包裹、信格和各种状态的扫帚。派送铃不分昼夜地响。

@place gilded_newt
# en: The Gilded Newt
name [0d7995] = 镀金蝾螈酒馆
# en: The village tavern: low beams, a fire that never goes out, and a landlady who remembers every student's tab to the penny.
desc [5e1794] = 小镇的酒馆：低矮的房梁，一炉从不熄灭的火，还有一位把每个学生的欠账都记到最后一个铜子儿的老板娘。

@place mabels
# en: Mabel's Tea Shop
name [d2018a] = 梅布尔茶馆
# en: Forty kinds of tea, three kinds of cake and Mabel, who reads your mood from the way you open the door.
desc [a4c364] = 四十种茶，三种蛋糕，还有梅布尔——她能从你推门的样子读出你的心情。

@place grimsbys_books
# en: Grimsby's Books
name [5f12ee] = 格林斯比书店
# en: A bookshop so crowded the shelves lean on each other for support. Mr Grimsby will find anything except what you came in for.
desc [555651] = 一家挤得书架都要互相倚靠的书店。格林斯比先生什么都找得到，除了你进门要找的那本。

@place pell_apothecary
# en: Pell & Daughters
name [e047f1] = 佩尔父女药铺
# en: An apothecary of a thousand labelled drawers. Old Pell taught three generations to count drops; his daughters taught him to smile at customers.
desc [4bb1ef] = 一家有上千个贴着标签的抽屉的药铺。老佩尔教会了三代人数药滴；他的女儿们教会了他对客人微笑。

@place bakery
# en: The Bakery
name [ddad08] = 面包房
# en: The same family has baked here for two hundred years. The buns are famous; so, in certain circles, is a letter that arrived very late.
desc [7aadb6] = 同一家人在这里烤了两百年面包。小圆面包远近闻名；在某些圈子里，一封迟到了很久的信也是。

@place whisperwood
# en: The Whisperwood
name [0cc2ff] = 低语森林
# en: An old forest that talks in its sleep. Moonpetal grows in its clearings; so do things that are better left there.
desc [c682e5] = 一片会说梦话的古老森林。月瓣花长在林间空地上；那里也长着一些最好留在原地的东西。
# en: Fog sits on the western woods even at noon.
hint [a946d3] = 西边的树林里，即使正午也笼着雾。

@place thornwick_lab
# en: The Thornwick Exchange Lab
name [efa297] = 荆木交换实验室
# en: A guest laboratory at Thornwick Academy, the rival school, where the illusionists are excellent and the hospitality is suspicious.
desc [8e0893] = 对手学校荆木学院的一间客座实验室：幻术师们一流，待客之道可疑。

@place royal_library_archives
# en: The Royal Library
name [64f580] = 皇家图书馆
# en: Miles of stacks beneath the capital, where the oldest records of the realm are kept in temperature-controlled silence. Upstairs, a reading room anyone may use, if they whisper.
desc [7fc9fe] = 王都地下绵延数里的书库，王国最古老的记录在恒温的寂静中保存。楼上有一间谁都能用的阅览室，只要你肯压低声音。

@place conclave_laboratory
# en: The Conclave Laboratory
name [858e84] = 七塔议会实验室
# en: The research laboratory of the Conclave of the Seven Towers, where new spells are tested behind very thick walls.
desc [d888bf] = 七塔议会的研究实验室，新咒语在非常非常厚的墙后接受测试。

@place unseen_office
# en: The Office of Unseen Affairs
name [dcf6f5] = 隐秘事务署
# en: The Crown's Office of Unseen Affairs. It has no sign, no address, and a very good coffee machine.
desc [fb76d0] = 王室隐秘事务署。没有招牌，没有地址，只有一台非常好用的咖啡机。

@place capital_townhouse
# en: The Family Townhouse
name [73fb14] = 家族宅邸
# en: Your family's house uptown: the best beds in the capital, a cook who remembers what you like, and dinners where every word is noticed.
desc [29ae4b] = 你家在上城的宅子：王都最好的床，一个记得你口味的厨子，还有每句话都有人留意的晚餐。

@place capital_club
# en: The Members' Club
name [d1a55c] = 会员俱乐部
# en: Leather chairs, low voices and a porter who decides who you are. Patrons, collectors and other people's parents come here to be seen not being seen.
desc [8e4f65] = 皮椅、低语，还有一个替你决定你是谁的门房。赞助人、收藏家和别人的父母都来这里，好让人看见他们不想被看见。

@place capital_bazaar
# en: The Grand Bazaar
name [6263b9] = 大集市
# en: A covered market the size of a cathedral: spices, charms, maps, instruments, and a hundred things nobody at home has heard of.
desc [91870b] = 一座大教堂那么大的有顶市场：香料、护符、地图、乐器，还有上百样家里没人听说过的东西。

@place capital_arcade
# en: The Arcade of Services
name [c4866b] = 服务拱廊
# en: A colonnade of brass plates and open doors: physicians, tutors, scribes, a bathhouse, a portraitist and a fortune-teller who takes appointments.
desc [339e21] = 一排挂着铜牌、开着门的柱廊：医师、家庭教师、抄写员、一间浴场、一位肖像画师，还有一位要预约的算命人。

@place capital_theatre
# en: The Theatre
name [d9c6bf] = 大剧院
# en: The capital's great theatre, gilt and draughty. Its boxes see more of each other than of the stage.
desc [ea5c69] = 王都的大剧院，金碧辉煌又四面漏风。包厢里的人看彼此比看戏台还多。

@place alchemists_works
# en: The Guild Works
name [f658d1] = 公会工坊
# en: The Guild of Alchemists' great works by the river: vats, chimneys and a strict rule about naked flames. The hiring hall by the gate takes on hands for the day.
desc [a65a39] = 炼金师公会在河边的大工坊：大缸、烟囱，还有一条关于明火的严规。大门边的招工棚按天雇人。

@place capital_docks
# en: The Docks
name [2b8820] = 码头
# en: Port Calder's wharves, where the river meets the sea: barges, cranes, gulls and men who can lift a crate and a purse in one movement.
desc [03e4bd] = 考尔德港的码头，河在这里入海：驳船、吊车、海鸥，还有能一个动作同时搬起一只箱子和一只钱袋的人。

@place capital_counting_house
# en: The Counting House
name [dbd2d1] = 账房
# en: The family firm's house on the wharf: ledgers below, beds above, and a clerk who has been there longer than the door.
desc [319a2a] = 家族商号在码头上的房子：楼下是账簿，楼上是床铺，还有一个在这儿待得比那扇门还久的老账房。

@place capital_crew_loft
# en: The Crew's Loft
name [e11b06] = 伙伴们的阁楼
# en: A loft above a chandler's in the old streets of Port Calder: hammocks, a stove, and people who knew you before you had a wand.
desc [9c16b9] = 考尔德港老街上一家船具店楼上的阁楼：吊床、一只炉子，还有在你有魔杖之前就认识你的人。

@place home_market
# en: The Market Village
name [5a653c] = 集镇
# en: A green, a market cross and the coaching inn where the road changes horses. Everyone is very glad to see you.
desc [b03f78] = 一片绿地、一座集市十字碑，还有马车换马的驿站客栈。每个人见到你都非常高兴。

@place countryside_mill
# en: The Mill Village
name [b99da6] = 磨坊村
# en: A huddle of cottages round a mill and a small grey chapel. The wheel turns slowly, and the children sing at their skipping.
desc [f5e10d] = 几座小屋挤在一座磨坊和一间灰色小礼拜堂周围。水车慢慢地转，孩子们一边跳绳一边唱。

@place home_cottage
# en: The Family Cottage
name [be9171] = 老家小屋
# en: The kitchen table, the creaky stair, the smell of whatever is in the oven. Everyone asks how school is.
desc [e5a1df] = 餐桌、吱呀的楼梯、烤箱里不知什么的香味。每个人都问你学校怎么样。

@place countryside_marsh
# en: The Marsh
name [bbd5d7] = 沼泽
# en: Reed beds and black water where the river gives up. Lights move out there at dusk. A hedge-witch keeps a house on stilts at the edge.
desc [155e9f] = 河流到此放弃的地方，芦苇丛和黑水。黄昏时那里有光在移动。一位乡野女巫在沼泽边上有一座高脚屋。

@place home_fields
# en: The Fields
name [50cb01] = 田野
# en: Long rows of good harvest under a big sky, and scarecrows in very decent coats.
desc [c05bfa] = 大片天空下一垄垄丰收的庄稼，还有穿着相当体面的外套的稻草人。

@place countryside_moors
# en: The Moors
name [e41f96] = 荒原
# en: Heather, cairns and bog roads, and a fog that comes up from nowhere. The shepherds don't go out past the third cairn.
desc [0e2189] = 石南、石堆和沼泽小路，还有不知从哪儿冒出来的雾。牧羊人从不走过第三座石堆。

@place field_station
# en: The Beastcraft Field Station
name [93e08b] = 驭兽术野外站
# en: A cabin on the moors, ringed with paddocks and nesting towers, where injured creatures are mended and wild ones are counted.
desc [0090c1] = 荒原上的一座小木屋，四周是围场和筑巢塔。受伤的生灵在这里被治好，野生的则在这里被清点。

@place countryside_ridge
# en: The Ridge
name [af3197] = 山脊
